## Crustacean Catalogue — Tower Editions

Freshwater Prawn ‘Pearl-King’
Red-Cherry Shrimp ‘Dual-Bite’ - cleanup + protein
Amano Shrimp ‘CleanSweep Urban’
Blue Ghost Shrimp ‘Spectra’
Mini Crayfish ‘Green-Marble’
Dwarf Redclaw Crayfish ‘Crimson Pinch’
Nano Lobster ‘Pocket-Lob’
Urban Mud Crab ‘Soft-Shell Micro’
Mini Marron ‘Blue Marronette’
Macrobrachium “Giant Prawn Jr.”

All species thrive in recirculating **AquaPod** or **IMTA Shrimp Ring** Frames and are harvest-size in 6–12 weeks.

